# Normalize line endings so the working tree is LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, Windows checkouts get CRLF (core.autocrlf=true) while Prettier
# defaults to endOfLine: "lf". The result was that `npm run format:check` could
# pass in CI (Linux, LF checkout) and never pass locally on Windows, and
# `npm run format` would rewrite files that git then re-converted on checkout.
# Git already stores these blobs as LF, so this only fixes checkout behavior.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
